      {%- comment -%} EN product pages: the product's SEO title_tag is stored in French ("… | Livraison gratuite — Ameublo Direct") and already contains shop.name, so the localized suffix below is skipped. Build a clean EN title from the (translated) product.title instead. {%- endcomment -%}
